  environment for services not in the stack, uses named volumes, and adds the hattisar service.
- volumes/db/roles.sql sets a password only for the pgbouncer role (used by supavisor's
  auth_query); the roles of absent services keep no password.
- volumes/db/_supabase.sql, volumes/db/pooler.sql and volumes/pooler/pooler.exs are unmodified.
